## Implemented

`two_bucket.py` — BFS over `(amount_one, amount_two)` states, returning `(actions, "one"|"two", other_liters)` and raising `ValueError` when the goal is unreachable. The first action fills `start_bucket`; any successor where the starting bucket is empty and the other is full is skipped.

